{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yJ6aIuQEqi1795825668.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>龍豐集團截至9月底止中期，按年多賺近兩成三。</p><p></p><p>盈利1.34億元，當中核心純利1.44億元，增長一成七。中期息每股派16.2仙。期內收入增長一成九，至17.64億元，主要得益於零售網絡擴張、客流量提升及新開設零售店的貢獻。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T01:03:52.609857+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T00:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:17.539082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T00:57:17.831801+00:00","content_hash":"e95c97afebd0dc227fd88ae98f163f27fdc82031c8066cf3a3dbfa465be82f32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}